WEBVTT

00:43:28.530 --> 00:43:30.326
Thank you so much for joining us.

00:43:30.350 --> 00:43:33.223
If you like what you heard,
please rate and review the show.

00:43:33.247 --> 00:43:34.570
It helps people find us.

00:43:36.292 --> 00:43:38.292
(WorkLife theme music)

00:43:43.550 --> 00:43:45.386
And are you still a potato?

00:43:45.410 --> 00:43:47.536
LO: I'm sorry -- am I still a potato?

00:43:47.560 --> 00:43:49.706
AG: Yeah, I mean, you're potato boss now.

00:43:49.730 --> 00:43:51.781
You have to be a potato, right?

00:43:52.310 --> 00:43:54.716
LO: (Chuckles) The funny thing is,

00:43:54.740 --> 00:43:57.346
the first time I got the request
to be a potato,

00:43:57.370 --> 00:43:59.323
I couldn't figure out how to be a potato.

00:43:59.347 --> 00:44:02.316
(Laughs) It took me --
it was like the opposite problem.